<title>USA: Uruguay seeks one mln bbls of crude for Oct 1-10.</title>
<headline>Uruguay seeks one mln bbls of crude for Oct 1-10.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uruguay's state oil refiner ANCAP is seeking to buy one million barrels of crude oil for October 1-10 delivery, trade sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The formal tender is scheduled to be issued on August 8, with an award due next week.</p>
<p>The company is looking to buy crude with an API gravity of 26-45 degrees and a sulfur content of 0.5 percent to 1.8 percent.</p>
<p>The crude is to be delivered to Uruguay's Jose Ignacio terminal.</p>
<p>In its last purchase tender, ANCAP bought one million barrels of Iranian Heavy crude from Brazil's state oil company Petrobras for delivery in the second half of August.</p>
<p>((--Patricia Garip-Bertuol NY Energy Desk ((+1 212 859 1620))</p>
